# Render Static Site — SPA Routing Rules
#
# Without this file, Render returns 404 for any URL that is not
# a physical file (e.g. /dashboard, /login, /patients/:id).
# This catches all such routes and serves index.html so React Router
# can handle them client-side.
#
# The service worker (sw.js / workbox-*.js) and manifest files are
# physical files so they are served directly — this rule does not affect them.

